OL,3,GNEWSACeltic Connections reveals 2027
OL,4,Afestival programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribute to the Beatles, a takeover of
OL,7,Fthe Kelvingrove Art Gallery and a
OL,8,Fspecial gig by film composer AR Rahman
OL,9,Fare among the shows unveiled for next
OL,10,Fyear's Celtic Connections festival in
OL,11,FGlasgow.
OL,13,FThe 34th edition of the folk, roots and
OL,14,Fworld music event will run from 14
OL,15,FJanuary until 31 January and open with
OL,16,Fa special concert by Scotland's GRIT
OL,17,FOrchestra, playing orchestral
OL,18,Farrangements of some of well-known folk
OL,19,Fsongs.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
