OL,3,GNEWSACeltic Connections reveals 2027
OL,4,Afestival programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusicians from over 20 countries will
OL,7,Fperform while a new membership scheme
OL,8,Fwill offer reduced tickets to people
OL,9,Funder 26.
OL,11,FLast year's festival saw about 114,000
OL,12,Fpeople attend shows across the city.
